  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rc7MUQx.png\" width=\"4585\" height=\"334\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">這張 Minecraft 地圖將帶你展開一場以「終極幸運方塊 2」模組為中心的刺激且充滿挑戰的冒險，</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">包含超過 20 種不同類型的幸運方塊。</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">你將出現在虛空中的浮空方塊上，必須不斷擊碎幸運方塊才能生存。祝你好運！</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">但這還不是全部。每擊碎 3 個方塊，幸運方塊的類型就會改變，帶來全新的驚喜與挑戰！</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">在探索這個獨特且限定的世界時，準備好迎接充滿驚險、危險與契機的體驗吧！樂趣永不間斷！</h3>\n<hr>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DGCQnGt.gif\" width=\"917\" height=\"514\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iCl4tBz.png\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2</a></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2</a></span><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2</a></span><br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-blocks-ultimate-2</a></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iCl4tBz.png\"><br></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>我的 Discord：</em></strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/B9rysAEFGk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Discord-logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"240\"></a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">點擊此處享受 25% 折扣</span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e786a9cc-b379-4f61-b906-ed81aeb57024.png\" width=\"1351\" height=\"224\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
